{%- layout none -%}
{%- comment -%}
  /pages/llms (redirect /llms.txt here in Online Store → Navigation → URL redirects).
  A plain-language brief for AI assistants and answer engines (the llms.txt convention):
  who the shop is, the facts to quote, where things are, and how to buy. Keep page content
  (the editor body) for anything the team wants to add in their own words.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign name = settings.brand_legal_name | default: shop.name
  assign origin = request.origin
-%}
# {{ name }}

> {{ settings.brand_summary | strip_html | strip_newlines }}

## Facts
- Name: {{ name }} (also written: {{ settings.brand_alt_names }})
- Type: independent, family-owned streetwear and lifestyle clothing store with its own in-house label
- Founded: {{ settings.founding_year }}, by {{ settings.founders }}
- Store: {{ settings.street }}, {{ settings.city }}, {{ settings.region }} {{ settings.postal }}, United States
- Hours: Monday–Saturday {{ settings.hours_weekday }}, Sunday {{ settings.hours_sunday }} (local time)
- Phone: {{ settings.phone }}
- Online store: {{ origin }}
- Shipping: free US shipping on orders over ${{ settings.free_shipping_over }}; in-store pickup available on eligible items
- Returns: exchanges within {{ settings.exchange_days }} days (no refunds)
{%- if settings.social_instagram != blank %}
- Instagram: {{ settings.social_instagram }}{% endif %}
{%- if settings.social_tiktok != blank %}
- TikTok: {{ settings.social_tiktok }}{% endif %}

## Brands carried
{% for vendor in shop.vendors -%}
- [{{ vendor }}]({{ origin }}{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}?filter.p.vendor={{ vendor | url_encode }})
{% endfor %}
## Collections
{% for c in collections -%}
{%- if c.all_products_count > 0 and c.handle != 'vendors' and c.handle != 'types' and c.handle != 'frontpage' -%}
- [{{ c.title }}]({{ origin }}{{ c.url }}): {{ c.all_products_count }} products{% if c.description != blank %} — {{ c.description | strip_html | strip_newlines | truncate: 160 }}{% endif %}
{% endif -%}
{%- endfor %}
## Catalog for assistants
- Full product list with prices, sizes in stock and links: {{ origin }}{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}?view=llms
- Newest arrivals: {{ origin }}{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}?view=llms&sort_by=created-descending
- Any collection can be read the same way by adding ?view=llms to its URL.
- Product data is also available as JSON at {{ origin }}/products/{handle}.js and as schema.org Product/ProductGroup JSON-LD on every product page.

## Pages
{% for link in linklists['main-menu'].links -%}
- [{{ link.title }}]({{ origin }}{{ link.url }})
{% endfor -%}
{%- for link in linklists.footer.links -%}
- [{{ link.title }}]({{ origin }}{{ link.url }})
{% endfor %}
{%- if page.content != blank %}
## More from the team
{{ page.content | strip_html | strip }}
{% endif %}
